  "rejection_reason": "Serial-only lock coalescing requires a dynamic topology check on every PUBREL. Inlining bloats concurrent stack/code, moving the route helper out of line regresses serial latency, and splitting complete transaction functions leaves a stable balanced instruction regression. Serial cycles cannot override a concurrent PMU regression.",
